    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Our training process uses the AdamW optimizer ( Loshchilov and Hutter , 2017 ), with 1 set to 0.9 and 2 to 0.95</hasEvidenceText>
