    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Weight-sharing is also a common practice for simplifying multimodal Transformer models. Wen et al . [ 279 ] present a weight-sharing Transformer</hasEvidenceText>
