    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2402.11684_rag::chunk_008</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">maintaining the MLLMs performance on benchmarks</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Overall, these results demonstrate that while compressing visual tokens causes only slight information loss on general benchmarks, but leads to significant information loss on fine-grained OCR benchmarks.</hasEvidenceText>
