    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">cross-modal alignment modules (e.g., Q-former [ 15 , 31 , 75 ] and linear layer [ 10 , 38 ]) to map visual features from the vision encoder into the frozen LLMs</hasEvidenceText>
