    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A multi-modal large language foundational model architecture that uses a frozen vision encoder and a large language model equipped with gated cross-attention for cross-modality alignment.</skos:skos_definition>
