    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">synthetic generative data has emerged as a powerful method to augment existing training datasets</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">training it on different sizes of subsets from the MegaPairs dataset to verify its scalability.</hasEvidenceText>
