    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">We concatenate the top-left location token &lt;loc 1 &gt; , the bottom-right location token &lt;loc 2 &gt; , and special boundary tokens &lt;box&gt; and &lt;/box&gt; , to represent a single bounding box</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
