    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A majority of Transformer-based multimodal pretraining works in a self-supervised manner, however, it is overly dependent on the well-aligned multimodal sample pairs/tuples.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
